= Find anything

You found a note by its *title* with `Space f`. The palette (`Space ?`) does
the same, and lists every command.

== Challenge 2

`Space /` searches the *text* of every note. The next step is the only note
that talks about a tall tower by the sea, whose lamp guides ships at night.
Its name is made of two words, *light* and *house*, written as one. Search
for that word, and open the result whose title it is.
